WEBVTT

00:04:25.476 --> 00:04:30.756
These decoys lead your brain activity
down neural pathways that go to them

00:04:30.796 --> 00:04:33.036
and not to the word you're looking for.

00:04:33.436 --> 00:04:36.516
So now when you try to retrieve
the word in question,

00:04:36.556 --> 00:04:38.916
all you can come up with
is the ugly sister.

00:04:39.356 --> 00:04:40.956
Here's an example.

00:04:40.996 --> 00:04:43.076
I recently asked my boyfriend,

00:04:43.116 --> 00:04:45.876
"What's the name of that famous surfer?

00:04:45.876 --> 00:04:47.076
Lance?

00:04:47.076 --> 00:04:48.916
No, it's not Lance."

00:04:49.396 --> 00:04:51.196
He knew who I was talking about,

00:04:51.196 --> 00:04:53.116
but he couldn't come up with it either.

00:04:53.156 --> 00:04:54.916
We were both stumped.

00:04:54.916 --> 00:04:57.876
And turns out my blurting out
the wrong name

00:04:57.916 --> 00:05:01.516
set my boyfriend's brain
to Lance Armstrong,